FAR plugin module - shell file and folder link support 

Version 1.15 (Tempora mutantur) 05.09.99

Creates shell link to an object selected in FAR panel on desktop
or in another panel current folder.
Resolves shell link to a folder and changes current panel folder
to linked one.

